// Leaf: IsTimeBetween
// Retail: Fable.exe (TLC, VC7.1) function @ 0x00658620, 246 bytes (`ret 8`; Ego_r.pdb `?IsTimeBetween@CTCVillage@@QBE_NABV?$vector@J...@@J@Z`).
